1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Maya (invented) is a nurse. She saw billing fraud.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
She wants to report it anonymously.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
But she writes: "I am the only night-shift nurse on Ward 3."

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The hotline hides her IP address. The text still points at her.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Anonymity fails through content, not the channel.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
This is Traceless. It finds what gives you away, on your device, before you send.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I load an invented sample report.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Traceless prepares Gemini Nano inside Chrome. Nothing is sent.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Now the proof. I turn the internet off.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
I check my report.

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
It still works. The badge says: checked on your device.

12
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The raw text never left this browser.

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Internet back on.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Every finding is a card.

15
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Here, a unique role and a shift.

16
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
I accept a safer rewrite.

17
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
This one names the person I accuse. It is not about me. So I click: Not about me.

18
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Nothing changes unless I decide.

19
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Then a second look. Traceless can miss things. So I must re-read my report, and confirm.

20
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Only then can I continue.

21
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
In the outbox, I see the final text.

22
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
I approve it.

23
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Now the cloud helps. Gemini organizes the approved text only.

24
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,000
The badge says so: only your approved text.

25
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Category, summary, when, where.

26
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,000
I send it. I get a case key, shown once.

27
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Later, I enter it at slash case, and see the status. No account needed.

28
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Raw text runs on the device only. The cloud gets approved text only.

29
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,000
One policy file decides every route. Firebase AI Logic, App Check, Auth, Firestore, Remote Config and Hosting.

30
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:23,000
We tested on 22 new reports, written blind. Recall was 0.709.

31
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:28,000
But the error rate on accused people, 0.072, missed its target.

32
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:34,000
The data is synthetic. Traceless will miss details. It says so.

33
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Traceless. Check your report before it leaves your hands. Try it now. The link is below.
